  <SequenceName>k__BackingField: 2-3 A
  lines:
  - speaker: 1
    text: CHARON, YOU SEE THIS RIGHT?!
  - speaker: 1
    text: "THEY MAKE SUCH A GOOD COUPLE DON\u2019T THEY?!"
  - speaker: 0
    text: "Well judging by how they\u2019re looking at us, surely it wasn\u2019t
      all sunshine and rainbows?"
  - speaker: 1
    text: Charon, honey, how did YOUR last relationship go?
  - speaker: 0
    text: "Look, that wasn\u2019t going to go anywhere"
  - speaker: 1
    text: OH? How do YOU know that?
  - speaker: 0
    text: "Aphrodite got involved, said it wasn\u2019t going to work out"
  - speaker: 1
    text: AND YOU JUST LISTENED TO HER?
